desc.massText:
Entry in "masses" — a Mass, a devotion or confession; once or as a series:
{keys}
Names of devotions as they are usually written (Polish): Różaniec, Droga Krzyżowa, Gorzkie Żale, Nabożeństwo majowe, Koronka do Miłosierdzia Bożego, Adoracja Najświętszego Sakramentu, Nieszpory.

desc.occurrenceText:
Item in "occurrences" — one Mass on one day, like a row in the book of intentions:
{keys}
The same Mass a second time in the document is merged with the first (with a warning).

desc.intentionText:
Intention in "intentions" — just text ("For the late John Smith") or an object:
{keys}
The text “wolna” (free) instead of an intention means "free": true.

desc.seriesText:
New Masses and devotions together with intentions — a new series has no "id" yet, so items point to it through "@name":
{sample}
Changing times from a chosen day (e.g. the evening Mass from 1 December at 17:00): an entry with "id" from the export, "time": "17:00", "changeFrom": "2026-12-01".
